\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God is love: His mercy brightens
\par All the path in which we rove;
\par Bliss He wakes, and woe He lightens:
\par God is wisdom, God is love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Chance and chance are busy ever;
\par Man decays, and ages move;
\par But His mercy waneth never:
\par God is wisdom, God is love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. E'en the hour that darkest seemeth
\par Will His changeless goodness prove;
\par From the gloom His brightens streameth:
\par God is wisdom, God is love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He with earthly cares entwineth
\par Hope and comfort from above;
\par Everywhere His glory shineth:
\par God is wisdom, God is love.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

